#: gui/cleanmate_gui/duplicates.py:209
msgid ""
"Find photos that look alike — resized or re-saved copies, edits, shots taken "
"one after another — keep the best of each and move the others to the Trash. "
"You can undo it. Your photos are read on this computer only."
